  "note": "P11 heartbeat-v1 (D52.4). Milliseconds on the app's monotonic clock for one control connection. Each step first applies its inbound extension frame `in` (if any), then evaluates the app's heartbeat tick at atMs. hello starts a fresh connection: seq restarts at 0 and heartbeat is active only when its capabilities list heartbeat-v1. Pinging and the loss deadline start at the first status after a negotiated hello; the ping schedule is measured from that status and from each sent ping. Every inbound frame type refreshes liveness. Loss is checked before pinging; after controlLost the connection is gone until the next hello. `wire` lists app pings and the extension's exact reply (null: no reply, no side effect).",
